<title>USA: Potlatch sees Q1 share under estimate.</title>
<headline>Potlatch sees Q1 share under estimate.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Potlatch Corp said Wednesday it expects first quarter earnings to be under the consensus of analyst estimates.</p>
<p>It blamed the shortfall on depressed prices for panel products, especially oriented strand board, as well as continued low prices for most of its pulp-based products.</p>
<p>According to First Call, the consensus estimate is for first quarter net income of $0.41 per share, compared with $0.17 last year.</p>
</text>
